<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="177214619"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:08.413"><div begin="28.990" end="53.497"><p begin="28.990" end="34.535" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.990" end="29.683">谁能够</span><span begin="29.683" end="30.306">将</span><span begin="31.095" end="31.539">天上</span><span begin="31.539" end="31.907">月</span><span begin="31.907" end="32.726">亮</span> <span begin="32.902" end="33.276">电源</span><span begin="33.276" end="33.671">关</span><span begin="33.671" end="34.535">掉</span></p><p begin="35.941" end="41.251" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.941" end="36.638">它把你</span><span begin="36.638" end="37.328">我</span><span begin="38.139" end="38.539">沉默</span> <span begin="38.539" end="38.940">照</span><span begin="38.940" end="39.714">得</span><span begin="39.758" end="40.324">太明</span><span begin="40.324" end="41.251">瞭</span></p><p begin="42.890" end="48.268" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.890" end="43.434">关</span><span begin="43.434" end="43.986">于爱</span><span begin="43.986" end="44.556">情</span><span begin="45.046" end="45.948">我们了</span><span begin="45.948" end="46.867">解</span><span begin="47.088" end="47.655">得太</span><span begin="47.655" end="48.268">少</span></p><p begin="49.848" end="53.497" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.848" end="50.429">爱了以</span><span begin="50.429" end="51.114">后</span> <span begin="51.114" end="52.000">又不</span><span begin="52.000" end="52.267">觉</span><span begin="52.267" end="52.798">可</span><span begin="52.798" end="53.497">靠</span></p></div><div begin="54.217" end="1:07.877"><p begin="54.217" end="59.259" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.217" end="55.976">你和</span><span begin="55.976" end="56.975">我</span> <span begin="56.975" end="57.511">看</span><span begin="57.511" end="58.127">着霓</span><span begin="58.127" end="59.259">虹</span></p><p begin="1:00.095" end="1:02.503" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.095" end="1:00.62